OL,3,GNEWSALifting vehicle used to steal ATM
OL,4,Abefore explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have used a lifting vehicle to
OL,7,Fsteal a cash machine from a shop in
OL,8,FWarwickshire, before setting the
OL,9,Fmachinery they used on fire and causing
OL,10,Fan explosion.
OL,12,FThe ATM was taken from the store on
OL,13,FHigh Street in Fenny Compton at about
OL,14,F02:40 GMT.
OL,16,FThe suspects set the telehandler
OL,17,F(telescopic handler) alight and made
OL,18,Foff with the stolen ATM, Warwickshire
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
